l, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nested structure + 9 namespaces (common, auth, chats, messages, calls, communities, novedades, settings, errors) split so resources can be lazy-loaded per namespace; en is default/fallback, es supported"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_language_detection_chain", "label": "Language detection priority chain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 Locked decision T2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "localStorage \u2192 navigator.language \u2192 user_settings (when logged in, overrides \u2014 cross-device sync is the source of truth once authenticated) \u2192 fallback en; convertDetectedLanguage normalizes es-MX/es-AR/en-US to es/en"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_theme_preference_system", "label": "Theme preference system (light/dark/system)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71-\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "data-theme='dark' attribute is only set for explicit dark because light is the default :root \u2014 the CSS from Prompt #3 relies on this; two dimensions kept separate: mode (attribute) \u00d7 accent (class)"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_accent_system", "label": "Accent color system (6 themes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71, \u00a76, \u00a713", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "blue/purple/red/orange/yellow/green applied via <html class='theme-{accent}'>; default blue; oklch swatches shown in AppearanceScreen"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_fouc_prevention", "label": "FOUC prevention (inline blocking script)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a712, \u00a717", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The script must be inline and blocking: it must run before CSS paints; a deferred script would still flash the wrong theme"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_dual_persistence", "label": "Dual persistence (localStorage + user_settings)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 Locked decision T6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Theme, accent, and language are written both to localStorage and user_settings; localStorage wrapped in try/catch because Safari private mode throws; after login the user_settings fetch overrides localStorage for cross-device sync"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_user_settings", "label": "user_settings table (shared preferences store)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a77, \u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Columns theme, accent, language already exist (schema must NOT be changed in this prompt); defaults per user_settings default in #4a: theme=system, accent=blue, language=en"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_intl_formatters", "label": "Intl-only locale formatters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 T5, \u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Use only native Intl APIs \u2014 no date libraries (moment/date-fns/dayjs forbidden); Intl.RelativeTimeFormat with numeric:'auto' yields 'yesterday' instead of '1 day ago' intentionally"}, {"id": "_roadmap_14_i18n_theme_prefers_color_scheme_listener", "label": "prefers-color-scheme runtime listener", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "14-i18n-theme.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 T7, \u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "matchMedia change li